Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:06.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, welcome to all of you out in cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, and I have a wonderful collection of colleagues here in physical space and we're going to have an interesting conversation with Jensen Hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:20.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, I would waste your time by introducing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:30.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, everybody knows Jensen, but um what you may not know is that he he started from fairly humble roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:33.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your mom was a school teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:36.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your dad was a petroleum engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You and I share one thing in common is that's we both started off our first job was running a dishwashing machine in a res in a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Denny's, you you What was What was your restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:53.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was at Mount Rushmore when all the you but you did better than I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:01:02.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,He became he became a uh bus boy and later a waiter and then I guess led him to Nvidia the head of Nidia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know it's a remarkable story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.62,0:01:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's I think it's the quitessential American story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:09.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,that uh you know we welcome people who come with just energy and imagination and creativity and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:24.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,they make an astounding success and thank you congratulations and thank you thank you for joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to uh we're going to have a very interesting conversation today colleagues and u you know it's um Nvidia is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,not only a huge economic success but it's a national security platform and I think we want to talk about that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been looking at your um at your website and you do talk about uh Nvidia's being a platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:55.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,A platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:02:00.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,A platform is something that you build other things upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:07.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is the largest pure play technology company the United States has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:10.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're the largest pure play technology company the world's ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We create technology out of nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our final product is pure technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:25.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in order to use it, you have to create software and applications for various industries above it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:31.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, if you look at most of the technology companies today, some of it could be in social media, some of it could be in e-commerce,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:38.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,some of it could be in information search and and these are all amazing technology companies whose business models are something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:40.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our business model is purely technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the way that that AI works and and uh our technology works is that in the final analysis the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,technology platform is built in layers and that's one of the reasons why we think of it as a platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.78,0:02:55.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're standing on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:59.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,An application or an industry stands on top of that platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:02.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,That platform starts with energy on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the reasons why why uh this administration uh has made such a huge difference right away if it's is this pro-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,energy growth initiative its attitude about energy is that if we don't have energy we can't enable this new
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,industry to thrive it is absolutely true so layer one is energy layer two are essentially the chips and systems
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:31.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the chips that's where Nvidia comes in layer three is a whole bunch of software and we build a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:35.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,whole bunch of software on top of our chips and we're well known for this piece of software called CUDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:41.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there's hundreds of different pieces of software that we create that enables people to do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI for different fields of science or language or images or whatever it happens to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.36,0:03:47.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,robotics or manufacturing and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that third layer is called infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:55.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Basically software now people historically have thought of infrastructure really as cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:04:01.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,But increasingly it's really important to realize that infrastructure includes land, power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:07.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,shell because these are and I'll speak about this in a second that this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,industry spawn another industry altogether and I'll come back to that but the third
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,layer is basically infrastructure and that infrastructure includes financial services because it takes an
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:23.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,enormous amount of capital to do what we do and historically all of that software.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:29.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the layer above that and this is where people largely focus on when they talk about AI which is the AI models.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.61,0:04:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the revolutionary of course Chad GPT uh incredible work that anthropic does
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.28,0:04:41.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,with cloud and uh Google does with Gemini and uh what XAI does with Grock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:52.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the important thing to realize those are four of the one and a half million AI models in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:05:02.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,M AI is not just intelligence that understands English or language, but it's AI that understands genes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:09.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,proteins, chemicals, the laws of physics, AI that understands quantum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understands physical articulation, otherwise known as robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:23.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understands patterns across long sequence of time, financial services,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI that understand longitudinally across multiple modalities, healthcare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:33.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so AI has all of these different reaches and domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,We talk about this one area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:39.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just have to be very careful to understand that AI AC spans
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,basically every form of information across every field of science across every single industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,One and a half million AIs around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,On top of that are all the applications and we never should forget that in the final
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:06:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,analysis these AI models are technologies but technologies are about enabling application and use whether you're in healthcare
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:14.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know you could be in entertainment manufacturing self-driving cars transportation each one of these industries have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:23.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,AIs that deeply affect them and these are the five layer stack Nvidia is at the lower level,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,the platform level.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:28.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason why we say that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:33.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're AI company that works with every single AI company in the world is because we're the platform by which
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.77,0:06:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are able to work with all of these technology companies and all these application companies across all these industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:43.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that is a platform that we created.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:46.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,the mode that people describe, not so much a mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,but basically the the language by which all of these different applications and these
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,different technologies speak to us is an architecture we invented 25 years ago called CUDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on top of that CUDA libraries, a whole bunch of algorithms that we invented over the years and that is basically Nvidia's platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end, we don't build self-driving cars, but we work with every single self-driving car company in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end, we don't discover drugs, but we just have we work with every single drug discovery company in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:23.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're the platform by which they build their things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're a platform company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:32.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I think half of I had a half a dozen young kids come up to me today say Nvidia gave them a better gaming experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean you all here before I before we invented the AI industry the first industry we created is the modern gaming industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:43.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,You you don't know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.46,0:07:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia is the world's largest gaming platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:49.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:55.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And probably didn't know that there that's how most of the kids were talking to me about that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to see a 300 million active users.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.97,0:08:02.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. a 100 million of them Nintendo Switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nvidia's in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You said something um recently that was quite provocative.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:21.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,You you said that China was winning the AI race, the AI competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um um I know that you've got a powerful, you know, competitor in Huawei and Huawei has a lot of advantages you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't you describe this competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are we really losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was a very good headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:41.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was a great headline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.47,0:08:41.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and u apparently caught up of a lot of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:54.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh uh the the as you know with headlines the disclaimer part uh the foundation part was left out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:09:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,headline but but the the way to think about that is that let me just handicap it right now if you look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,at AI and go back to the first thing that we said AI is a five layer cake let's just always simplify
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.96,0:09:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's not it's not quite this simplistic but let's simplify AI
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:20.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,into a five layer cake energy chips infrastructure models and applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, I just and let's hand the capital across the from top from bottom to top at the lowest level energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:30.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,China has twice the amount of energy we have as a nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:37.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to ask about that twice as much energy as we have as a nation and there our economy is larger than theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.87,0:09:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Makes no sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:44.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also know that one of the most one of the most important initiatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,one of the most important policies of this administration and there was the first thing that President Trump said to me when we met is listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:54.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,we need to reindustrialize America.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to unshore manufacturing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.62,0:10:01.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to make we need to help America make things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:03.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's going to create jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.82,0:10:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,that part of the economy has been outshored on you offshored uh and completely gutted the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:13.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to bring that back and he needs my help to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.21,0:10:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so that entire sector of the economy is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,missing and however without energy how do we build chip plants,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:30.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,computer system plants and these AI data centers we call them AI factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.19,0:10:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're building simultaneously three different types of factories in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chip factories, supercomputer factories, and AI factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They all require energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:46.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so on the one hand, we want to re-industrialize the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you do that without energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:51.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the fact that we vilified energy for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:11:00.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,President Trump sticking his neck out and making taking it on the chin and helping this helping the country realize that energy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.71,0:11:06.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,is necessary for our growth is one of the the really one of the greatest things he's done right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:14.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now at the energy level, back to that stack, we're, you know, 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.48,0:11:16.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they're growing straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're kind of flat right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so number one, uh, energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.53,0:11:23.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two, chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're generations ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are generations ahead on chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think everybody recognizes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number three, infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.93,0:11:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you want to build a data center here in the United States, from breaking ground to standing up a AI supercomputer is probably about three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.52,0:11:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,They can build a hospital in a weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:48.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's a real challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.78,0:11:54.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so at the infrastructure le layer, their velocity of building things because they are builders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:58.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Their velocity of building things is extraordinarily high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:02.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, really quickly on on chips, we're several generations ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,But don't be complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:08.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, semiconductors is a manufacturing process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anybody who thinks China can't manufacture is missing a big idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But China discounts energy costs for a chip company by 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:26.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,They they provide free transportation for employees to come out to the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:26.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:34.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, our energy cost is more expensive than theirs in the first place and then they discounted 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, it's probably we're probably call it four to eight times the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:39.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.04,0:12:45.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, tell me, how do you feel about this this Jake? this great competition with China.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:52.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, the the the the government is putting enormous resources underneath their champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.03,0:12:56.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't do that in this country, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh how do you feel about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, before I get there, don't don't let me not answer that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.84,0:13:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm dying to answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,But let me handicap the next two layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:14.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,The large the language the model layer the model layer United States frontier models United are our frontier models
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,are unquestionably world class we are probably call it six
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:27.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,months ahead however out of the 1.4 4 million models,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,most of them are open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:33.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,China is well ahead, way ahead on open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:40.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, the reason why open source is so important is because without open source, startups can't thrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,University researchers can't do research.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't teach AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scientists can't use AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Basically all of the industry around the your economy have no ability to fundamentally advance themselves unless you have open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.84,0:13:59.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without Linux, where would we be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without Kubernetes, you know, without PyTorch, all of these different types of technologies that made AI thrive are all open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are well ahead of us on open source.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:13.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then the layer above that applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you were to do a poll of of um uh their society and ours and you ask them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is AI likely to do more good than harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're going to say in their case, 80% would say AI will do more good than harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.16,0:14:34.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,In our case, it'd be the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that tells you something that's very, very important. socially.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Socially, we need to be careful not to describe AI in these science fiction movie ways of describing AI and and causing people so much concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:54.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, we want to be concerned, but we also want to be practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:57.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,AI is about automation and that area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:02.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think that we need to be careful not to fall behind in the application and the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:12.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,diffusion of AI because in the end whoever applies the technology first and most wins that industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:17.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, electricity was invented discover invented in the UK,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.19,0:15:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the United States applied it faster more broadly and as a result, look where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, we have to be a little mindful and so anyways, I just handicapped that stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:35.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I don't think it's it's important when you're looking at AI not to see it as a holistic thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really not about chat GPT versus Deepseek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to look at it across all of the stacks and across all of the industries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a little bit more complicated than one simple answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,but do you feel you have a level playing field up against China putting their resources under Huawei?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:16:04.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh I f first of all I America's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.22,0:16:11.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,technology industry just as our financial financial services
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,ind industry our military our technology industry we can all agree are the mightiest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:32.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am part of one of the mightiest technology, mightiest industries anyone in history has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have going toe-to-toe against anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.36,0:16:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The American technology industry has nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're inventive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll take anybody on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, we can't concede the market to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:54.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, at the moment, Nvidia has been banned from going to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention, China has banned Nvidia going to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:17:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, so we're we're this I think we're the first company in history that has been banned on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.92,0:17:12.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, and so, so, uh, whoever, whoever banned us, uh, going to China,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,um, uh, them and China, uh, agree that Nvidia should not go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, I'm being a little I'm being a little cute here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:27.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll I'll be a little bit more nuanced here in a second, but at the moment, we're simply not competing in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:36.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have conceded essentially the second largest AI market, the second largest technology market in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.88,0:17:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know China will it's not somebody has said to me well yeah okay well we're not in China but we're going to grow somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're not going to replace China.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:53.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's just as the world wanting to sell to America and they want to export to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:57.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,If they don't export to America, you're not going to replace United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:18:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are singular in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are absolutely singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:07.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so in the case of China, um we shouldn't concede the entire market to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:13.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're formidable, but conceding that entire market, uh we ought to go compete for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.10,0:18:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Having said that, we should also acknowledge that Huawei is one of the most formidable technology companies the world has ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:31.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,They deserve, although they have a lot of support, um, whatever support they have, they deserve all of the respect that everybody ought to give them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,We compete with this company.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:34.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:35.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're agile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:38.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,They move incredibly fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:45.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We said if United States was not in China, China's AI industry would be set back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:46.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:47.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Absolutely has not happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,As a result, their semiconductor industry has double double double.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.57,0:19:00.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, the semiconductor industry in the west around the world is growing at 20 30% per year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:05.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Growing 20 30% per year compounded versus doubling every year compounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.38,0:19:08.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't take long to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But, you know, they're starting on second base and we're just going up to the batters box.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, they've got a real advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that means we need to think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:27.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can I ask ask you we at the G20 summit uh Lee Kashang you know the premier was there and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:35.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,he was offering um opportunities for countries to be participants
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.23,0:19:40.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,with China on AI and we didn't even send a delegation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:43.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like we're in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're smart about um technology proliferation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:20:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,If we apply if we use 5G as an example, they realize 5G is technology that's also a platform because on top of 5G,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,you build all kinds of services on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:11.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, if you get there first, wherever you get first, if you get there first, just as Nvidia, I was there 25 years first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I had you know for a long time nobody paid me any never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I had lots and lots of time to build up all these ecosystems and applications and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.48,0:20:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,relationships and ecosystems and I connected all this stuff together in all these different fields of industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had 25 years to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:38.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the case of Huawei with 5G they were we were they were completely through policy completely isolated people thought in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:42.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,So they had a billion phone users all but to themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,It gave them the opportunity to grow scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:51.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,They exported the technology to all of the countries that belt and road and now there's AI belt and road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.38,0:20:59.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so they'll definitely per diffuse the Chinese technology as quickly as possible because they understand that the sooner you get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:03.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sooner you build the ecosystem on top, the sooner you become a sticky,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:09.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,you become sticky, you become essential part, a dependent part of that ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.51,0:21:14.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the Chinese ecosystem they're trying to create.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obviously, it is it's deep and it's robust and that it has a physical as well as a technological and economic dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.31,0:21:24.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.64,0:21:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take a step back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Remember, I think it's like nine out of the 10 top science and technology schools in the world are now in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,They lead in science and technology in many different fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,This has completely flipped in the last half to a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We used to lead most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now they lead most of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have a large population of highly qualified students.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.52,0:21:54.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:22:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two, 50% of the world's AI researchers are Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Third, 70% of last year's AI patents are published by China.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.08,0:22:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ecosystem of AI in China is vibrant, rich, incredibly innovative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.88,0:22:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:20.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,They work incredibly hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.30,0:22:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a country with an enormous might.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that is the ecosystem of software developers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.00,0:22:33.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that layer, as I just mentioned, the model and the application layer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.81,0:22:39.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,all of these scientists, they're sitting at the model and the application layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now they're going to take that capability because United States is no longer participating in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:49.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've left China.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.46,0:22:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're evacuated that market.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.44,0:22:53.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've conceded that market.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:56.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so now they they've got to go build their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:23:01.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So using these AI researchers, all of this incredible computer scientists that they have,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.40,0:23:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,their richness of software capability, and they're going to go build their own complete stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.64,0:23:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once they build that entire complete stack, they'll export it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:12.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,As quickly as you could imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:20.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is the the world what we will find someday if we don't activate will be buyers, not sellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:24.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're in Washington DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.51,0:23:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know you don't look forward to those opportunities, but um we're um it's my only opportunity to wear a suit and a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:41.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um but but let me ask because um you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.01,0:23:50.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're um we're in we're involved in something I've not seen before in in my 45 years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:54.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we've delved into industrial policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:24:01.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I always thought industrial policy was something that we shouldn't be doing in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.70,0:24:02.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:11.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Biden administration decided that they would define what they would allow you to sell
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and they have this thing that they called diffusion that they were trying to manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.80,0:24:18.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now you get the Trump administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.89,0:24:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't have that, but they want a golden share and they want a percent of the cut, you know, on how you're doing business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.51,0:24:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me about how you look at this this industrial policy that we have in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.68,0:24:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I do agree that that um industrial policy uh should
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:47.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,should intervene when a dramatic action needs to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:59.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, I also would say that President Trump walked into a circum into a situation where dramatic actions needed to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first dramatic action that needed to be taken is to reverse the mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:14.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,that have been made in energy growth over the course of the last decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.96,0:25:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are we have we have done our country a great disservice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.36,0:25:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,There there are no new industries you can grow without energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.12,0:25:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.84,0:25:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.72,0:25:27.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need electricity because otherwise sure we could all be in the services industry and as you know
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:44.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,the service industry only needs calories but manufacturing industry needs electricities and so uh we need energy number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.31,0:25:48.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Number two we do need to if we want to if we want to fix our social
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:56.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,issues domestic social issues we have to create prosperity not just for people with PhDs and college degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.39,0:26:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have to create prosperity for every segment of the economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the largest segment of the economy is manufacturing and we've offshored that too for too long for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.98,0:26:12.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,We got to bring that back and we have the ability to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.94,0:26:21.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this AI industrial revolution, this flash point is precisely when we should do it because it allows us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.11,0:26:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it it created a company called Nvidia, made it possible for us to have such a large ecosystem of suppliers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.73,0:26:29.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can encourage them to partner with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.36,0:26:34.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can encourage Taiwan to partner with us to help us reindustrialize the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.78,0:26:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And they've done so with great support.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:42.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taiwan really needs to have some acknowledgement for the incredible effort
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:46.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that they're putting in place to help us re-industrialize the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.21,0:26:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,If not for the work that they're doing, the work that the work that Nvidia has done in Arizona wouldn't have made the progress that has.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I recently gave a congratulation speech at TSMC in Arizona.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.09,0:27:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And when I looked out into the audience, it was twothirds Taiwanese and one-third American.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.44,0:27:11.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Arizona is practically well, the quality of Taiwanese food in Arizona, let me just put it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:16.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The quality of Taiwanese food in Arizona has increased tremendously.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.44,0:27:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, you want to get a bowl of get a bowl of beef noodle soup, you're going to do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.05,0:27:29.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,But but but all these young all these young uh families from Taiwan came to help us stand up our our factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.74,0:27:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we should acknowledge that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.70,0:27:35.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and South Korea helping us stand up our memory manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.10,0:27:36.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should acknowledge that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.74,0:27:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh the companies uh Foxcon, Wis, Wistron, Amcor, Spill helping us set up systems manufacturing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:45.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,They came from Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.99,0:27:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:56.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so one if not for the fact the second industrial policy is to reindustrialize the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:28:00.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,That I think is a fantastic fantastic initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.40,0:28:01.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm all behind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.95,0:28:08.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was probably the first CEO to jump behind that and take advantage of Nvidia's capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:13.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this flash point of AI industrial revolution to help bring all of that supply chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.63,0:28:15.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,I committed to my customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.26,0:28:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,my partners that we're going to build in this administration within within President Trump's term half a trillion dollars of AI supercomputers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:29.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that's the second part, energy growth, re-industrializing the United States.
