Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.95,0:28:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,nation's extraordinary technology industry is part of our national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:29:06.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fact that we have our technology all over the world that the world relies on to build their industries,
