Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:13.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a strength of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.12,0:29:18.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It helps keep United States safe when everybody works with us.
