Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.91,0:29:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um you know I think I think national security there are two two dimensions of national
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,security and I differentiate small case and large case small case national security small N small
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.20,0:29:43.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,s um I think that's you know aircraft carriers and bombers and divisions and training programs
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.23,0:29:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,capital national security NS is the uh dynamism of your economy the the productivity of your industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:30:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,the creativity of your ideas industry, uh the sense of fairness in your judicial system.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.76,0:30:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you are here, you you benefit from that larger case, but you're building that larger national security industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:21.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,tell us how you think about your role uh on national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:27.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh number one, Nvidia was birthed in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.36,0:30:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are a proud American company.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.68,0:30:33.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're inventive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.11,0:30:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're vibrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.36,0:30:42.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're at the center of the single most important industrial revolution in human history.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.40,0:30:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an industrial revolution in every single way as important as electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.37,0:30:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to impact every single industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every single company, every country will build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:56.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every company will use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.88,0:31:06.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We export American technology wherever the United States would like us to export the American technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.96,0:31:16.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is an extraordinary opportunity for us to make a substantial contribution to our national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:23.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We also know that national security and economic security and economic prosperity go hand in hand.
