Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.78,0:31:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I do believe that it is the case we are because of this new industrial revolution that we've started,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:43.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,we are creating new factories in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.54,0:31:46.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're creating new jobs in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.22,0:31:51.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And somebody recently told me that we contributed more to economic growth singularly
