Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,technology the economic prosperity that we can contribute to unquestionable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.96,0:32:30.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now this the question then becomes how do we think through the
