Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.40,0:33:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should number two ensure that American companies, American technology companies through partnership with us have the benefit of the best and first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.20,0:33:10.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,But then after that, after number one and number two,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.24,0:33:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,we should also proliferate American technology standards, compete around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.36,0:33:28.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,fuel this flywheel of funding, yeah, our R&D so that we can continue to be to be the mightiest technology industry in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.38,0:33:37.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that we can fund the tech the mightiest military in the world and all of that I think goes hand in hand. several times.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:45.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, you know, Chairman Dwang, you've talked about energy as being a pacing problem here.
