Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.58,0:34:06.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we're now really way behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.05,0:34:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you pointed out that China has built out twice the capacity of electricity than has the United States.
