Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:30.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think at this point we have to use every form of energy we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.06,0:34:32.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe we can't rely on the power grid.
