Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.44,0:34:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,We obviously need power generation systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.24,0:34:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no question we should try to encourage and try to accelerate nuclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.84,0:34:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to have energy growth very, very shortly.
