Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.90,0:37:21.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to get in trouble for for my saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.39,0:37:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you, I mean, last year, thank you for that.
