Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.39,0:38:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I say, "Now cause Jensen to reach over and pick up the cup."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The AI creates pixel by pixel, token by token my arm picking up the cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.57,0:38:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that everybody knows is possible today.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You guys have seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.69,0:38:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the AI can't tell the difference between it manu manipulating pixels versus it's manipulating a bunch of motors.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.24,0:38:53.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the idea that I can tell the robot pick up the cup is clearly just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.60,0:38:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just have to take that AI which currently sits in the cloud and we have
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.24,0:39:05.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,to put it into otherwise called embody it into a physical mechanical system which is called robotics.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.78,0:39:08.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,So the AI is around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.30,0:39:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We can see early evidence that the technology must be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now China is going to be very very good at this for several reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.73,0:39:19.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,They have great demand.
