Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.29,0:41:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,maybe something my wife will look up but we need to make this that would be a miracle indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.76,0:41:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It would be good but we we need to turn this into productive machinery and the way in which it's going to change the the landscape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.00,0:41:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you, we're because we're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.65,0:41:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, you know, I was talking to a friend of mine who's a dean of a of a major research institute,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.67,0:41:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I asked him, I said, "How is your faculty dealing with uh with AI?"
