Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:34.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.88,0:42:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some jobs will become obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.72,0:42:45.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,New jobs are going to be created and every job will be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.28,0:42:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,So that let me just I used two words just now and it's really important we think about these two words very differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.73,0:42:55.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,One is task the other one is job.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.35,0:43:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now it turns out I think it was something like seven eight years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:10.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,a very important AI scientist maybe the most important AI scientist declared the first application
