Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.63,0:43:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,in fact entire radiology industry in within five years will be completely transformed by AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.24,0:43:33.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,die and that in a in five years time radiologists will all lose their job and he advises that no one should be a radiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:38.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,That was his advice and it was taken very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.56,0:43:40.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now some five, six, seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.44,0:43:47.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,eight years later every single radiology platform
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.07,0:43:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,has been completely transformed by AI 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.88,0:44:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,every single radiology platform the number of radiologists has increased.
