Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.56,0:44:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because as it turns out studying the scans, studying the images is the task of a radiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.44,0:44:22.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The goal or the job of a radiologist is to diagnose disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.64,0:44:25.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is true for many many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.52,0:44:31.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,People say I don't need software engineers because apparently coding is going to be automated.
