Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.96,0:44:45.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,100% of NVIDIA has AI assistants, AI coders, and they're busier than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.00,0:44:52.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the question is what is the task versus what is the job? no different than a financial analyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.99,0:44:58.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The task is mess around with spreadsheets, but the job is to make a financial advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.94,0:45:01.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,The job is to help a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.78,0:45:05.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The job is to analyze a market, make a prediction about market.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.63,0:45:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so there's still the human factor is still quite significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.16,0:45:20.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would just tell everyone before you decide that the the the that AI uh is something that you're you're you're worried about or scared about,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.95,0:45:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,go engage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.82,0:45:22.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.64,0:45:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And even in the humanities, the fact of the matter is as without, you know, with AI today, my writing has improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think the quality is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.44,0:45:42.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,It still writes in my my taste and my my ways, but my speed of writing has dramatically improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.48,0:45:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I'm more productive today.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.77,0:45:47.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm still writing the original pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.08,0:45:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have to write the original voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.20,0:45:54.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have to we I still have to create the original thought still has but every so often as you know when
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.83,0:46:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,we derive uh other speeches out of other previous speeches the concepts are very similar but the content the delivery the context is
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.09,0:46:11.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,so different we we now can use AI to help us regenerate the first draft you know so so for me u for
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.68,0:46:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,the humanities I would just say original thought original writing your taste made with human hands are still always going to be valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.36,0:46:23.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,I went in for an MRI recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.27,0:46:25.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,My wife said, "Make sure you take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.35,0:46:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's a brain up there, but I'd like to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.57,0:46:30.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Prove there's something."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.68,0:46:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um, and what what did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.72,0:46:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,There was there was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.04,0:46:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, she was right and I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.52,0:46:45.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh, we're we're coming to the end and and um you're in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.59,0:46:54.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don't this isn't always a joyful experience to come to Washington but um share with us what your you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.11,0:47:02.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,know you know your thoughts on how we should think about this remarkable uh revolution that's appearing in your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.53,0:47:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're leading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.63,0:47:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to experience it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.27,0:47:08.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're probably going to try to regulate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.58,0:47:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't know how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.34,0:47:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,what uh tell us just a little bit how you think we should be anticipating this and thinking about our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.92,0:47:21.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um there are many of course that we we spoke about many different things that
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.20,0:47:29.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,that uh Washington has been uh extraordinarily helpful in already shaping the outcome for our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.19,0:47:38.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we spoke about industrial policies and and how in fact a heavyhanded approach was necessary and it was just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.63,0:47:49.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh it is the case that Washington DC is foreign to me and and um I I've had the benefit of coming here now uh since the first time I
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.38,0:47:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,saw you uh our first our first night and um it's unnatural to me uh
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.10,0:48:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,however however what I I can tell you is uh we all want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.04,0:48:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want America to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.71,0:48:07.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want America to be the greatest nation in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.26,0:48:10.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,M we have extraordinary capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.90,0:48:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm you know it's hard not to be romantic about this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.44,0:48:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,My my my parents had the American dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.76,0:48:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,My father always want wanted us to grow up in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sent us here when I was nine and um I and they they had almost nothing uh
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.88,0:48:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh to to start a life here and uh somehow through that journey it worked out pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.15,0:48:38.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm I'm here uh with the privilege of leading one of the most consequential companies in the history of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.72,0:48:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.36,0:48:43.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and uh you just can't you can't write a better story than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.31,0:48:43.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.60,0:48:46.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can't not be romantic about this this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.52,0:48:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by extraordinary scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.77,0:48:50.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by extraordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.93,0:48:55.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um all of our technology partners, the ecosystem that we here we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.09,0:49:01.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it is, you know, I don't want to be complacent, but it's it is a miracle that there's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.98,0:49:05.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I' I have the benefit of working with every nation in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.26,0:49:14.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I I think it's we can say for for certain that we want the same we want the we want the same outcome for this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.50,0:49:21.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is important however uh that I I come here so that I could at least explain what is AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.98,0:49:23.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's five layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.40,0:49:25.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can explain what is impact,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.58,0:49:34.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,how is it going to evolve and how how certain policies although um on appearance uh might
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.74,0:49:43.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,achieve whatever objectives that the long-term consequences the unintended consequences could be quite dire for the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.57,0:49:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I have the benefit of at least explaining it from the perspective of technology and
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:57.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,um uh help advocate uh for for uh uh technology leadership so that we could secure our national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.51,0:50:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I have that benefit and and I I'm deeply grateful uh that that uh uh
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.81,0:50:08.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,the people I get to get to meet here in Washington DC has always had an open
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.16,0:50:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,door and you know although this is new for me and I'm clumsy at it uh I
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.35,0:50:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,can also say that I'm very grateful that that um Washington has been very open to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.60,0:50:20.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know the answer to this question but I still want to ask it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.67,0:50:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you optimistic about the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.20,0:50:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh absolutely a thousand% a thousand%.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.88,0:50:28.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh the best of days are ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.97,0:50:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, it is the I don't have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.08,0:50:41.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think I've done, you know, I think that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:52.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and and Ambassador Rudd uh you know, when when he first met me, I had I my all my hair was black.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.94,0:51:01.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,and and now, you know, if you if you were to take an image of my brain, it could turn out to be the same color as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.37,0:51:08.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so um but but nonetheless, uh this is the one decade I will not miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.56,0:51:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.20,0:51:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I simply won't miss this decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.55,0:51:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want to miss this next two decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.65,0:51:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to do more for the advancement of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.64,0:51:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to do more for the advancement of industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.09,0:51:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are going to do more for this nation in the next two decades than potentially all of it combined in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.52,0:51:27.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I don't want to miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.75,0:51:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the best of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.20,0:51:30.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,I totally share.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.11,0:51:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think this is going to be the most marvelous period in humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.01,0:51:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we're looking forward to Would you all say thank you with your applause?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.96,0:51:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.12,0:51:48.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
